{"reviewId": "323501160_88hcdT6LW", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "认识到没有资产会永远上涨，也没有低谷会永无止境。在狂热中保持警惕，在萧条中看到希望。\n在周期的不同阶段，采取不同的策略。\n萧条期注重保值、积累现金和学习新技能；回升期和繁荣期则勇于拥抱新事物，风险投资～", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "899-986", "abstract": "以我们对康波的理解，虽然康波一般在进入衰退之后才更容易引起人们对这一理论的重视，但事实上，人生就是一场康波。康波的形成是人的集体行为的结果，而这种集体行为取决于人的代际更迭。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "323501160_88hcdT6LW", "userVid": 323501160, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775870564, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 323501160, "name": "α楠木", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-pc39mqbBbycKiZrw0DRgh10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "α楠木", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "一书一世界(不私信）", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250120-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 236, "likes": [{"userVid": 49817863, "name": "不知道", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0027-dnGbl77eLdXqXlw2cbJbS10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "不知道", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [{"content": "是啊，就像现在经济衰退期，很多人说学历贬值，开始躺平，但是没有永远的萧条，这个时期要的是苟着但是默默积累着", "reviewId": "323501160_88hcdT6LW", "commentId": "323501160_88hcdT6LW_c917607060_88Kro1zVQ", "userVid": 917607060, "cr